  m_GameObject: {fileID: 2132878594}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 9d7ea898f0605b46b3aa06c5dd60dfb1, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::HollowCurrent.Interactable
  Kind: 1
  Label: Furnace diary
  Body: 'OCTOBER 17


    It repeats the little things. A chair pulled out. A door
    left open. The house kept warm.


    I moved the music box upstairs. By morning
    it was back beside the furnace. The doll stayed where I left it.


    The same
    evening, again and again: the fourth chair, the warm room, that little song.
    It is the routine she cannot leave.'
  HidePoint: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
  ExitPoint: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
  Door: {fileID: 0}
  Circuit: {fileID: 0}
  RelicIndex: -1
  Art: {fileID: 0}
